  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dfd09f1fb2282b20",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 是一款全新的全模态理解模型，专为现实场景中的文档分析、多图像推理、自动语音识别、长音视频理解、智能体式计算机操作及通用推理而打造。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1d9c9298bb84641",
      "translationZh": "它将 Nemotron 多模态系列从强大的视觉语言系统，扩展为覆盖文本 + 图像 + 视频 + 音频的更广泛模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "098d8e13986d1666",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 在 MMlongbench-Doc、OCRBenchV2 等复杂文档智能排行榜上实现了同类最佳准确率，同时也在 WorldSense 和 DailyOmni 等视频与音频排行榜上处于领先地位。它在音频理解评测 VoiceBench 上取得了最高准确率，并在 MediaPerf 上被评为成本效益最高的开放视频理解模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "755d219d9435c48f",
      "translationZh": "在底层，它将 Nemotron 3 的混合 Mamba-Transformer 混合专家骨干网络与 C-RADIOv4-H 视觉编码器、Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v2 音频编码器相结合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f76074d5e9f4acdf",
      "translationZh": "该架构旨在保留精细的视觉细节，加入原生音频理解能力，并扩展至超长多模态上下文，以处理信息密集的图像、文档、视频及混合模态推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ded9644f68ca066f",
      "translationZh": "训练方案采用分阶段的多模态对齐和上下文扩展，随后进行偏好优化与多模态强化学习。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48ef18e7b9305967",
      "translationZh": "与其他方案相比，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 在多模态使用场景中的吞吐量最高可达其 9 倍，单流推理速度可达其 2.9 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46ba082dba31eeb2",
      "translationZh": "在 HuggingFace 下载 BF16、FP8 和 NVFP4 检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d62b154e8ec8f552",
      "translationZh": "有关模型架构、训练方案、数据流水线和基准测试的更多信息，请阅读完整的 Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0eb02192a23fd36",
      "translationZh": "基准测试亮点 在 Nemotron Nano V2 VL 的基础上，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 的视觉能力实现了显著提升，并新增了音频以及视频+音频能力，同时在许多领域领先于另一款开放权重的全模态模型 Qwen3-Omni。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bc74b21357c6cf5",
      "translationZh": "任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fa330e271ba9b77",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adc495b60e66be0f",
      "translationZh": "文档理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72b52c349567c191",
      "translationZh": "CharXiv 推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22fe7fb7cf3822d6",
      "translationZh": "图形用户界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "787a566f09ebe387",
      "translationZh": "视频理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca32a40e79d55170",
      "translationZh": "视频 + 音频理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0def9f4f1ebb6672",
      "translationZh": "语音交互",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfa8070bd95ecf82",
      "translationZh": "自动语音识别（ASR）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5e78e3a69a2e1e3",
      "translationZh": "HF Open ASR（越低越好）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3d84392d2b189c8",
      "translationZh": "效率亮点 与具有相同交互性的其他开放全模态模型相比，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 在多文档用例中的系统效率达到其 7.4 倍，在视频用例中的系统效率达到其 9.2 倍 图 1. 在固定的每用户交互性阈值（tokens/sec/user）下，各模型在多文档和视频用例中能够持续维持的系统总吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a6dff495e7122ae",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 的设计用途",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12d04a4642300e63",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 面向五类工作负载：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cd7a04f9b573d67c",
      "translationZh": "1. 真实场景中的文档分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "686e2acf393decaf",
      "translationZh": "这不仅仅是 OCR。该模型面向篇幅长、杂乱且价值高的文档，对这类文档的理解依赖于版面布局、表格、图示、公式、章节结构以及跨页引用。例如合同、技术论文、报告、手册、多页表单或合规材料包。该模型可以处理 100+ 页的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ddce32f41878f91b",
      "translationZh": "2. 自动语音识别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28a52d8a99008ed5",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 具备强大的语音理解能力，能够在多种音频条件下实现高质量转写。它可以处理包含不同说话人、口音和背景噪声的长音频。这些能力可以集成到更广泛的工作流程中，使口语内容得以转写、分析，并与其他模态结合，用于摘要生成、问答和跨模态推理等任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "85b4dce93906b12d",
      "translationZh": "3. 长音视频理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08ba99c422a62b3a",
      "translationZh": "许多企业和开发者工作流程依赖于混合的音频与视觉信息：带旁白的屏幕录制、培训视频、带幻灯片的会议、教程、产品演示、客户支持过程录制以及长视频档案。Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 专为对这些输入进行联合推理而构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "10f9fe4324a6b8ed",
      "translationZh": "4. 智能体式计算机操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f26d602cfd8f952d",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 模型经过专门训练，能够以智能体方式操作计算机，从而协助完成图形用户界面（GUI）环境中的任务。其能力包括解读屏幕截图、监测用户界面状态、以屏幕上的视觉信息为依据进行推理，以及协助选择操作或实现工作流自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d0317c31d1583400",
      "translationZh": "5. 通用多模态推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5e25f63b60d48b9",
      "translationZh": "该模型的设计目标不止于感知。它擅长需要综合长上下文窗口、多种模态以及结构化或半结构化证据中的信息的推理密集型任务。它能够开展多步推理、执行计算，并关联来自文本、图像、表格及其他输入的信号，从而得出连贯且依据充分的答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b8cc9860a4fb8f1",
      "translationZh": "模型架构与关键创新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "332dfeee33fec407",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 采用统一的编码器—投影器—解码器设计。其语言骨干网络为 Nemotron 3 Nano 30B-A3B，搭配 C-RADIOv4-H 视觉编码器和 Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v2 音频编码器。各模态专用编码器通过轻量级投影器接入 LLM 骨干网络。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bc41feb01b6bc11",
      "translationZh": "图 2. NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 30B-A3B 的模型架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1814ea463a0319d5",
      "translationZh": "面向长多模态上下文的混合 Mamba-Transformer-MoE 骨干网络",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f54d9da5fae78f04",
      "translationZh": "模型骨干交错排列了三个关键组件：23 个 Mamba 选择性状态空间层，用于高效处理长上下文；23 个 MoE 层，每层包含 128 个专家，采用 top-6 路由，并配有一个共享专家，以提供条件化容量；以及 6 个分组查询注意力层，用于保持强大的全局交互能力和表达能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "163a582c46e6e825",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 在统一设计中结合了状态空间模型、注意力和 MoE，在保持强大推理性能的同时，仍能切实适用于长多模态上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1a40bb40cae6e5d0",
      "translationZh": "面向密集文档、图表和屏幕的动态分辨率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fda6048794748148",
      "translationZh": "在视觉方面，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 将 v2 模型使用的分块策略替换为按原始宽高比进行的动态分辨率处理。每张图像可使用数量可变的 16 x 16 图像块来表示，每张图像的视觉块数量最少为 1,024，最多为 13,312。对于正方形图像，这分别相当于 512 x 512 和 1840 x 1840。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9611c2fd43dfaec",
      "translationZh": "这种灵活性对于处理高分辨率、复杂的视觉输入至关重要，例如需要大量 OCR 处理的文档、财务表格、幻灯片、研究图表、屏幕截图和 GUI 布局——尤其是在需要同时理解细微细节与整体结构时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e634c2b4a16ce7fa",
      "translationZh": "用于视频的 Conv3D 时间压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c520d6eadbd75c7",
      "translationZh": "对于视频，Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 使用专用的 Conv3D tubelet 嵌入路径。它并非独立地嵌入每一帧，而是在进入 ViT 之前，将每对连续帧融合成一个“tubelet”，从而使语言模型需要关注的视觉 token 数量减半。这使我们能够在相同的 token 预算下将帧数翻倍，或者在帧数相同的情况下将 token 数量减半",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f42feef892f2a7d",
      "translationZh": "EVS — 高效视频采样",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4898f8136d9b450b",
      "translationZh": "EVS 是一项重要功能，在推理时启用，可在视觉编码器之后丢弃冗余的视频 token。这在保持准确性的同时，降低了延迟并提高了吞吐量。视频的第一帧会被完整保留；对于此后的每一帧，EVS 会保留视频中发生变化区域的“动态”token，并丢弃相较于上一帧没有变化区域的“静态”token。我们将其与 Conv3D 结合，以实现更出色的压缩：Conv3D 将每对帧的 token 融合为一组，然后 EVS 剪除冗余的静态信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1cd83351eeec325",
      "translationZh": "原生音频输入，而不只是文本转录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96dad63b565588a4",
      "translationZh": "音频部分由 Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v2 驱动，通过其专用的 2 层 MLP 投影器连接到主干网络。音频采样率为 16 kHz，模型训练时使用的输入时长最长为 1,200 秒（20 分钟），而 LLM 的最大上下文长度支持 5+ 小时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5053b764b28481ac",
      "translationZh": "这标志着对传统 VLM 流水线的转变：在共享的多模态序列中实现原生音频处理，使音频、视觉和文本 token 能够被联合建模。这对于带解说的屏幕录制、语音会改变视觉含义的视频问答、长篇教学或会议内容，以及需要基于时间信息进行多模态推理的任务等场景至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9bee79176a4d256",
      "translationZh": "轻量级模态投影器与统一的 token 交错排列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a5e7f36aae4a834",
      "translationZh": "每个编码器都通过一个轻量级的 2 层 MLP 投影器连接到 LLM，该投影器将编码器特征映射到共享嵌入空间。投影后，视觉、音频和文本 token 会交错排列，并被联合处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc242139b934cfa4",
      "translationZh": "这一设计使整个系统保持模块化，同时仍能在主干网络内部实现真正的跨模态推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dfe639b164a7351a",
      "translationZh": "训练数据、基础设施与系统方面的介绍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36d2b8f15a76be59",
      "translationZh": "SFT 各阶段的训练在 NVIDIA H100 上进行，节点数量根据阶段从 32 个扩展至 128 个。技术栈使用 Megatron-LM、Transformer Engine 和 Megatron Energon，并采用张量并行、专家并行、序列并行、用于长上下文阶段的上下文并行、在线序列打包以及选择性激活重计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b02a4fc8cd7f1811",
      "translationZh": "SFT 后的强化学习使用 NeMo-RL 和 NeMo Gym，并采用 Megatron 后端。RL 基础设施采用基于 Ray 的分布式部署，横跨 B200 和 H100 集群，同时使用多模态去重，以免重复的 rollout 成倍增加图像、视频和音频的内存占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94db15c7c18fb611",
      "translationZh": "我们将训练代码中的相当一部分开源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cc3bd10b0e64bcf",
      "translationZh": "利用 RL 塑造可靠的多模态行为",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b1f67cb6404af79",
      "translationZh": "我们在 Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 中引入多环境文本训练和全模态训练。我们的文本 RL 训练阶段在 Nemo-Gym 的多种环境中进行，这些环境评估模型执行一系列操作的能力，例如工具调用、编写代码和多部分规划，并检验这些操作是否满足可验证的标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b720668f614bcab",
      "translationZh": "全模态 RL 在统一框架内训练模型跨图像、视频、音频和文本进行推理，涵盖从单模态到完整多模态场景的任务。一套多样化的验证器评估多项选择、数学、GUI 定位和 ASR 等不同形式的输出，同时有意纳入无法作答的案例，以教会模型在证据不足时放弃作答，而不是产生幻觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e39e05a5dca6c718",
      "translationZh": "数据与数据流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1a2b84c8b118714",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 使用增强的数据集进行训练，该数据集强调跨多种模态的高质量推理。我们显著扩展了任务覆盖范围，并针对公开数据集有限的复杂推理场景引入合成数据。为支持这一点，我们构建了针对特定任务的多阶段流水线，以实现可扩展的合成数据生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28262a9439ca2ff1",
      "translationZh": "举例来说，我们使用 NeMo Data Designer，从大量真实场景中的 PDF 文档组成的语料库中生成了约 11.4M 个合成问答对（约 45B 个词元）。该数据集用于在后训练阶段增强长上下文文档推理能力，并使 MMLongBench-Doc 上的整体准确率提升至原来的 2.19×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b0b986784c9a0c2",
      "translationZh": "我们在 Data Designer 开发者说明中详细介绍了整个流水线的演进过程，包括失败分析和总结出的关键经验。该说明还包含九个可运行的流水线方案，可作为构建您自己的文档理解数据集的起点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
